00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:38.050
the tidyverse team is making
a huge effort to not break

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:38.650
people's code.

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:40.540
And it was actually quite
difficult to find an example

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:41.360
where this fails.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:46.670
But anyway, so here is
code that ran in 2018.

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:49.730
And so I'm going to try
and run it today in 2021.

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:53.470
And what we're going to
find is that this code--

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:56.190
let me make this a little
bigger so it's easier to see--

00:19:56.190 --> 00:20:00.430
